        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "Gel-permeation chromatography (GPC) was carried out on a Waters chromatography unit interfaced with a Waters 2410 refractive index detector. Two Waters 5 lm Styragel HR-2 and HR-4 columns (7.8 mm I.D. × 300 mm) connected in series were used with tetrahydrofuran (THF) as the eluent. The data were calibrated with narrow polystyrene standards."
      },
