        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "An Instron universal tester model 1130 with a load cell of 5 kg was used to study the stress-strain behavior of the polyimide film samples. The test specimens gauge length was 2 cm, and the crosshead speed for film testing was 5 mm/min. Measurements were performed at room temperature with film specimens (0.5 cm wide, 6 cm long, and about 0.05 mm thick), and an average of three to five replicas was used."
      },
